<title>USA: Tapistron deleted from Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Tapistron deleted from Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>RINGGOLD, Ga. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tapistron International Inc said Nasdaq will delete the company from the Nasdaq Stock Market effective on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement late on Wednesday the deletion was &quot;a result of the company's non-compliance with the quantitative maintenance criteria for continued listing on the Nasdaq Stock Market.&quot;</p>
<p>Tapistron's common stock will continue to be publicly traded as a bulletin board stock, the statement said.</p>
<p>The company filed for Chapter 11 reorganization under the U.S. Bankruptcy Code in June.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
